@host = http://localhost:5000
@token =

### Create a player
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "MazeTester"
}

### Invalid username
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bad name"
}

### Duplicate username
POST {{host}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "MazeTester"
}

### List levels
GET {{host}}/api/levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Level 1
GET {{host}}/api/levels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get missing level
GET {{host}}/api/levels/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit valid escape
POST {{host}}/api/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelId": 1,
  "timeMs": 60000,
  "keysCollected": 2,
  "escaped": true
}

### Submit anti-cheat escape with no keys
POST {{host}}/api/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelId": 1,
  "timeMs": 60000,
  "keysCollected": 1,
  "escaped": true
}

### Submit escape below minimum time
POST {{host}}/api/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelId": 1,
  "timeMs": 1,
  "keysCollected": 2,
  "escaped": true
}

### Submit valid failed run
POST {{host}}/api/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelId": 1,
  "timeMs": 15000,
  "keysCollected": 1,
  "escaped": false
}

### Get leaderboard
GET {{host}}/api/leaderboard/1?top=10

### Get player progress
GET {{host}}/api/players/me/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
